 // (!op->vt[0x14]()) pump();`); this names the operation. Same walk and stops as BackChain.
+// Fix 156m: `std` saves all 64 bits, big-endian: the 32-bit value is the low word, at
+// back - 0x0C (156k read the high word at back - 0x10, always 0 or FFFFFFFF for a guest
+// address). The object's first kObjectWords words (its vtable, then its first fields).
+constexpr int kObjectWords = 4;
